    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#6$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "Say ah\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion",
        "text": "...Ah..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "No issues with the respiratory tract or vocal cords. The crystals in the lungs have not spread."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "Meaning that when you came to the Rhodes Island office a few days ago and stared blankly at our medics, it wasn't because your condition prevented you from speaking."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#2$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "Looks like I didn't have to come personally."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion",
        "text": "You've done a lot for the Infected of Athenius, and Rhodes Island's medicine is far more effective than what we had before. We all appreciate what you've done. I won't take up any more of your time..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "A checkup alone isn't enough."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "Minoan policies are relatively lenient when it comes to the Infected. With the exception of certain occupations, like the priesthood, the everyday lives of the Infected are usually not significantly affected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "Many people still believe that Oripathy saps the Minoan heroic spirit, though. That's why many patients are indifferent about treatment, even trying to hide their conditions."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "How many fingers am I holding up?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion",
        "text": "Four."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion",
        "text": "Thank you for the concern, Kyr\u00eda Athopoulou, but my condition is mild. The illness has not affected my vision."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "Then why did you visit the Rhodes Island office four times in the past two weeks?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#3$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion",
        "text": "Well..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "You're no great liar. Besides, I saw a Rhodes Island monitoring bracelet on Xanthos, your mentor."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "Have you been obtaining medication on his behalf?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion",
        "text": "Yes..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion",
        "text": "He forgets his appointments because he has so many things on his plate. It's only reasonable that I should pick up his medicine for him."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#14$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "But you did not register his name with the office, which means there are no records of him having contracted Oripathy."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion",
        "text": "He saved my life, taught me the lore of the water and the art of combat. He's been a good mentor to me. I didn't want people to know..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#14$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "To know that he couldn't be a <i>hero?</i>"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#13$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "Visiting the Oripathy clinic may color how others view you and Xanthos, but it will not change the path that you choose for yourselves."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "I'm not Kassandra, and soothing the heart isn't my thing. But I know that both of you need proper treatment."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#2$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "I'll move the two of you up the priority list and follow up closely on your conditions. You can prepare yourselves for a LOT of nagging."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#5$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion",
        "text": "You're more tenacious than you look."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#2$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "I wouldn't have to be, if I could buy your cooperation with a few grains of corn like the fowlbeast perching on your bow."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion",
        "text": "Sorry..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "Where is Xanthos, anyway?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "If your recent reports were indeed his, then he's suffered significant fluctuations in internal Originium levels during this time. He needs rest, as I said."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lykeion",
        "text": "I told him, but..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#13$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "Don't tell me he went to the crossing again?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
