            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "I'm busy preparing boats for the fruit farmers and craftsmen. Make it quick, Hek\u00e1demos."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos",
        "text": "...Why isn't Lykeion around to help? I never thought he would let you out of his sight."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "He took a day off. Home visit by a Rhodes Island doctor."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos",
        "text": "Home visit?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos",
        "text": "(Did the medicine he picked up not work? Is he so sick he can't even walk?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#14$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "If you came to communicate the Astynomos' 'suggestion', you're wasting your time. Tell her I'll deal with the problem at the crossing, and there's no need for her to worry."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos",
        "text": "Actually, she sent me to inform you that the problem has been resolved."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "Resolved? Pallas acted quickly this time."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos",
        "text": "No, it wasn't her who came up with the solution."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "Who was it, then? Did Kassandra calm the people down, or did the Astynomos pull another one of her little tricks?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos",
        "text": "Neither."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos",
        "text": "It was the Sargonian ambassador who resolved the dispute between the craftsmen and the fruit farmers. A small Feline with dark skin and black ears."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "A black-eared Feline..."
    },
