    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Ancient Minoans saw the beauty of marble, and sculpted legends and epics with hammers and chisels."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "In the <i>Kerespereia</i>, Kereseira walked through war and plague, wearing out thirty pairs of shoes, before she arrived at the mountain-rimmed garden."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "At the site of the First Temple, she saw a boulder split, and received a revelation from the gods."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Her gentle and wise visage reflected the Athenian morning sun; she protected the refugees who followed her and drove the outlanders out with her sword; and her harp\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi & Pallas",
        "text": "'Sings only the tales of the heroes!'"
    },
